      "side": 1,
      "message": "Setting the config option like this results in the following in the .config file:\n\nCONFIG_NPCX_HEADER_SPI_MAX_CLOCK\u003d50    // From this file\nCONFIG_NPCX_HEADER_SPI_MAX_CLOCK_20\u003dy  // Default choice automatically set\n\nTo fix this, the SPI clock choice defined here (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/zephyr/+/0356c821/soc/arm/nuvoton_npcx/Kconfig#30) needs to be given a label.\n\nFor instance:\n\nchoice NPCX_HEADER_SPI_MAX_CLOCK_CHOICE\n    default NPCX_HEADER_SPI_MAX_CLOCK_20\n    help\n       ...\n       \nendchoice\n\nThen to change the default, this file can use:\n\nconfig NPCX_HEADER_SPI_MAX_CLOCK_CHOICE\n    default NPCX_HEADER_SPI_MAX_CLOCK_50\n    \nThis can be cleaned up after fixing the Kconfig upstream.",
